tps://t.co/Rt2bbxUKn8","url":"https://x.com/0xTheo520/status/2117916020103094648"},{"author_id":"1870818143071059968","created_at":"2026-11-04T09:21:00.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2117909969517662632"],"id":"2117909969517662632","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":5,"impression_count":6424,"like_count":61,"quote_count":0,"reply_count":5,"retweet_count":0},"text":"去北京上个诉然后所有账号都给封了￼\n\n连李克强总理也只有一次言论自由，老百姓也不例外 https://t.co/ySrND6QBOG","url":"https://x.com/0xTheo520/status/2117909969517662632"},{"author_id":"1870818143071059968","created_at":"2026-11-04T08:55:00.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2117903426113925235"],"id":"2117903426113925235","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":1,"impression_count":970,"like_count":8,"quote_count":0,"reply_count":6,"retweet_count":1},"text":"我受够了，因为出生时的一个医疗错误，在 20 多年来我一直生活在痛苦\n（他们剪断了我的脐带，而不是割断我的喉咙）","url":"https://x.com/0xTheo520/status/2117903426113925235"},{"author_id":"1870818143071059968","created_at":"2026-11-04T08:30:00.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2117897137757491271"],"id":"2117897137757491271","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":0,"impression_count":894,"like_count":4,"quote_count":0,"reply_count":2,"retweet_count":0},"text":"当你发现你的朋友特别坏然后她还告诉你了她的邪恶想法的时候，她大概率已经把你当做能交心的人了，如果这个时候绝交你将会获得一个史诗级恶灵","url":"https://x.com/0xTheo520/status/2117897137757491271"},{"author_id":"1870818143071059968","created_at":"2026-11-04T08:05:00.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2117890843986268610"],"id":"2117890843986268610","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":2,"impression_count":868,"like_count":10,"quote_count":0,"reply_count":2,"retweet_count":0},"text":"就像你喜欢东南亚的松弛感，就得接受它会有脏乱差；你喜欢日本的秩序感，就得接受它的紧绷高压；你想念家的温暖熟悉，就得明白它是会绑架你的一部分自由的￼","url":"https://x.com/0xTheo520/status/2117890843986268610"},{"author_id":"1870818143071059968","created_at":"2026-11-04T07:38:00.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2117884048563642457"],"id":"2117884048563642457","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":0,"impression_count":931,"like_count":10,"quote_count":0,"reply_count":1,"retweet_count":1},"text":"听人说搜救犬会下意识地避开吃过狗肉的人群\n\n虽然不知道真假但这是我今年听过的最舒服的一句话了，良言一句三冬暖，谢谢好心人谢谢聪明狗","url":"https://x.com/0xTheo520/status/2117884048563642457"},{"author_id":"1870818143071059968","created_at":"2026-11-04T07:12:53.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2117877729471455473"],"id":"2117877729471455473","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":12,"impression_count":28109,"like_count":347,"quote_count":3,"reply_count":25,"retweet_count":0},"text":"我突然想起来之前高中上地理课讲日本排放核污水\n\n然后我们地理老师笑了笑说 你以为中国不排吗\n\n卧槽她经常说这种话我都害怕她哪天上着上着课被抓走了","url":"https://x.com/0xTheo520/status/2117877729471455473"},{"author_id":"1870818143071059968","created_at":"2026-11-04T06:44:00.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2117870459228430489"],"id":"2117870459228430489","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":37,"impression_count":27612,"like_count":277,"quote_count":2,"reply_count":11,"retweet_count":4},"text":"文革往事（身边真人真事）：\n\n某美院老师在文革期间，得亏为人处事得当，在即将被批斗抄家前得到了小道消息。然而他没跑，而是斥巨资购买当时流行的瓷制毛泽东半身像，摆满了屋内","url":"https://x.com/0xTheo520/status/2117870459228430489"},{"author_id":"1870818143071059968","created_at":"2026-11-04T06:20:00.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2117864419338367485"],"id":"2117864419338367485","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":18,"impression_count":10458,"like_count":147,"quote_count":0,"reply_count":10,"retweet_count":6},"text":"文革时期\n有一对夫妇被五花大绑，\n身上被绑满炸药\n造反派和革命群众让夫妇的孩子去点燃导火索\n孩子不愿干，\n就往死里打那个孩子。\n最后，孩子边哭边扑向爸爸妈妈\n点燃了导火索，孩子却没跑，\n紧紧的抱住了爸爸妈妈……\n-冯骥才《一百个人的十年》","url":"https://x.com/0xTheo520/status/2117864419338367485"},{"author_id":"1870818143071059968","created_at":"2026-11-04T05:56:00.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2117858379234476258"],"id":"2117858379234476258","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":0,"impression_count":1589,"like_count":15,"quote_count":0,"reply_count":3,"retweet_count":0},"text":"我不行了，差点让评论区笑死\n\n年休48天的工作 满日本打着灯笼都难找\n还没开业名声就臭了 笑死了 https://t.co/5XEFJShkJ7","url":"https://x.com/0xTheo520/status/2117858379234476258"},{"author_id":"1870818143071059968","created_at":"2026-11-04T05:28:00.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2117851332946149668"],"id":"2117851332946149668","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":3,"impression_count":2245,"like_count":15,"quote_count":0,"reply_count":3,"retweet_count":0},"referenced_tweets":[{"id":"2116533147961532653","type":"quoted"}],"text":"辱华这个词到底谁发明的。。\n\n中国人一边嘲笑韩国人吃不起西瓜，一边又说日本人都是小日本，又嘲笑印度人，又嘲笑非洲人\n\n中国人也很爱嘲笑世界各地的人。但是就没有什么辱美啊，辱韩这种词，偏偏有辱华，我有点搞不懂，好双标 https://t.co/LNCbNPjsls","url":"https://x.com/0xTheo520/status/2117851332946149668"},{"author_id":"1870818143071059968","created_at":"2026-11-04T05:02:00.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2117844790142505027"],"id":"2117844790142505027","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":2,"impression_count":1672,"like_count":11,"quote_count":0,"reply_count":1,"retweet_count":0},"text":"法国发生大规模智慧型冰箱遭骇事件\n\n一堆冰箱被骇客骇入，将冰箱温度调整至50度\n\n导致一堆食物腐坏\n\n目前这些灾难已经扩充到欧洲七个国家","url":"https://x.com/0xTheo520/status/2117844790142505027"},{"author_id":"1870818143071059968","created_at":"2026-11-04T04:44:00.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2117840259895468335"],"id":"2117840259895468335","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":12,"impression_count":13865,"like_count":98,"quote_count":1,"reply_count":8,"retweet_count":2},"text":"如果你觉得你犯的错已经很大了\n不妨看看这个吧\n\n二战日本签署投降协议时\n加拿大代表把自己的名字签在法国的栏位上 https://t.co/ihBNMadSP0","url":"https://x.com/0xTheo520/status/2117840259895468335"},{"author_id":"1870818143071059968","created_at":"2026-11-04T04:23:00.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2117834975315722319"],"id":"2117834975315722319","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":7,"impression_count":4085,"like_count":47,"quote_count":0,"reply_count":5,"retweet_count":6},"text":"愿所有善良的中国人都能够瞬间清醒\n\n也愿所有的中国人都能认清现实 https://t.co/6RAXO1M4Ks","url":"https://x.com/0xTheo520/status/2117834975315722319"},{"author_id":"1870818143071059968","created_at":"2026-11-04T04:03:00.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2117829942582952336"],"id":"2117829942582952336","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":0,"impression_count":791,"like_count":3,"quote_count":0,"reply_count":3,"retweet_count":0},"text":"邀请你们一起学 https://t.co/ixYtFTiflm","url":"https://x.com/0xTheo520/status/2117829942582952336"},{"author_id":"1870818143071059968","created_at":"2026-11-04T03:43:12.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2117824960316297409"],"id":"2117824960316297409","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":1,"impression_count":1146,"like_count":13,"quote_count":0,"reply_count":0,"retweet_count":0},"text":"末世降临 请选择你的专属房间 https://t.co/gnNxLILcIu","url":"https://x.com/0xTheo520/status/2117824960316297409"},{"author_id":"1870818143071059968","created_at":"2026-11-04T03:33:15.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2117822455545016643"],"id":"2117822455545016643","in_reply_to_user_id":"1870818143071059968","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":6,"impression_count":41440,"like_count":239,"quote_count":0,"reply_count":7,"retweet_count":1},"referenced_tweets":[{"id":"2117821641723990133","type":"replied_to"}],"text":"造谣的话 还必须是咱们人厉害呢 https://t.co/wXy2kn0qG8","url":"https://x.com/0xTheo520/status/2117822455545016643"},{"author_id":"1870818143071059968","created_at":"2026-11-04T03:30:01.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2117821641723990133"],"id":"2117821641723990133","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":128,"impression_count":242077,"like_count":429,"quote_count":3,"reply_count":181,"retweet_count":35},"text":"终于衣锦还乡了，太感人了🥲🥲🥲\n暖心祖国，移民定居日本13年，一时脑子抽风回去探亲，然后就“被恢復”中国国籍，然后限制出境十年🤣🤣￼ https://t.co/8s4pMgA7tr","url":"https://x.com/0xTheo520/status/2117821641723990133"},{"author_id":"1870818143071059968","created_at":"2026-11-04T03:00:01.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2117814092408717430"],"id":"2117814092408717430","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":2,"impression_count":2021,"like_count":66,"quote_count":0,"reply_count":6,"retweet_count":1},"text":"长大之后才意识到作为一个大人要看穿小孩子的勉强难过和委屈有多么轻松，所以小时候他们那样对我都是故意的","url":"https://x.com/0xTheo520/status/2117814092408717430"},{"author_id":"1870818143071059968","created_at":"2026-11-04T02:30:00.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2117806540576915887"],"id":"211780654057